OL,3,ANot building third runway would be
OL,4,A'huge missed opportunity', warns
OL,5,AHeathrow boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe airport's chief executive said if
OL,8,Fits owners could not invest in a third
OL,9,Frunway, the money "will be invested
OL,10,Fsomewhere else in the world",
OL,11,Fsuggesting a decision would be made in
OL,12,Fthe new year.
OL,14,FThe Department for Transport said it
OL,15,Fwas reviewing responses to a
OL,16,Fconsultation and was "considering the
OL,17,Fappropriate next steps".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
